{"id":4493,"date":"2025-06-30T02:26:14","date_gmt":"2025-06-30T02:26:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4493"},"modified":"2025-08-11T06:43:31","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T06:43:31","slug":"cach-san-sale-shopee-khong-lo-ve-gia","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-san-sale-shopee-khong-lo-ve-gia\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch s\u0103n sale Shopee th\u00f4ng minh, kh\u00f4ng lo v\u1ec1 gi\u00e1"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"J3uFdh1kpo46KrxyEvTlYNzTgcf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PnUlde8NJovz8Dx4UQCl7ZUZgOq\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1ch \u0103n sale Shopee th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o may m\u1eafn m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u1ea7n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng: n\u1eafm khung gi\u1edd Flash Sale, chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb s\u1edbm, canh m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng ShopeePay \u0111\u1ec3 thanh to\u00e1n si\u00eau t\u1ed1c. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ee3t sale l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 6.6, 9.9 hay 11.11, t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3. T\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a> ngay h\u00f4m nay!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-InsRdW3TWoqjgLxeo0DlYXBugrf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">1. T\u1ea1i sao c\u1ea7n bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch s\u0103n sale tr\u00ean Shopee?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Exmpd7EBGoyKG7xS7kRl0Y51gye\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch s\u0103n sale tr\u00ean Shopee gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m chi ph\u00ed, mua \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u1edbi gi\u00e1 r\u1ebb h\u01a1n nhi\u1ec1u so v\u1edbi b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 11.11, 12.12. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, s\u0103n sale c\u00f2n gi\u00fap t\u00ecm ngu\u1ed3n h\u00e0ng gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1ec3 kinh doanh dropshipping ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1n l\u1ebb, t\u0103ng l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1ed1n l\u1edbn. Ngo\u00e0i ra, hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1ch Shopee t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c sale (m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, flash sale, mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n) gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n n\u1eafm b\u1eaft c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i mua s\u1eafm th\u00f4ng minh, tr\u00e1nh b\u1ecf l\u1ee1 \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i ho\u1eb7c mua h\u1edb. H\u01a1n n\u1eefa, k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng n\u00e0y h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ph\u00e2n t\u00edch xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4501\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4501\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4501 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/3.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea1i sao c\u1ea7n bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch s\u0103n sale tr\u00ean Shopee?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4501\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u1ea1i sao c\u1ea7n bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch s\u0103n sale tr\u00ean Shopee?<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"J3uFdh1kpo46KrxyEvTlYNzTgcf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-UNIXdAt3EoiwHbx0USBlfoBngGh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2. Shopee t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c sale v\u00e0o nh\u1eefng ng\u00e0y n\u00e0o trong n\u0103m?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzV3dypWeo36YoxDfSMlcyzbgwc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n sale l\u1edbn quanh n\u0103m, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o c\u00e1c Double Date Sales (ng\u00e0y tr\u00f9ng s\u1ed1) v\u00e0 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp l\u1ec5, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ecbch c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n sale n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Shopee trong n\u0103m 2025, d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean th\u00f4ng tin t\u1eeb c\u00e1c ngu\u1ed3n \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady v\u00e0 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng h\u00e0ng n\u0103m:<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lr1ed3Rb1oc8a5xjjB7lFhr2gne\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4499\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4499\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4499\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/55-1.png\" alt=\"L\u1ecbch s\u0103n sale t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c khung gi\u1edd \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn nh\u1ea5t.\n\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/55-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/55-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/55-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/55-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/55-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4499\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">L\u1ecbch s\u0103n sale t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c khung gi\u1edd \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn nh\u1ea5t.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"J3uFdh1kpo46KrxyEvTlYNzTgcf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-D3oNdTdBhogHvGxjZcplXFLFgPb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2.1. Double Date Sales (Ng\u00e0y tr\u00f9ng s\u1ed1)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BrENdjxXbohSj9xsyURlrQkQg2f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng v\u1edbi c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i l\u1edbn v\u00e0o c\u00e1c ng\u00e0y tr\u00f9ng s\u1ed1, th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 &#8220;Mega Shopping Sale&#8221;:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AvAUdIqB8oAPoXxI3VolR4ITgl0\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>1.1: Sale \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m, kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u1edbi \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 to\u00e0n s\u00e0n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OZO2dDLy2oWikYx7ZTOlbHFMgxc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>2.2: Free Shipping Promo, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m trang tr\u00ed T\u1ebft v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E2t6dV8GKoysu1xWQ5slnpr9gof\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>3.3: Mega Shopping Sale, \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i l\u1edbn cho m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m, th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed3 gia d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XfHHdRNbRo5tBnxa5lhlUWopgEf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>4.4: Fashion &amp; Beauty Sale, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 m\u1ea1nh cho qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00e0m \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HgXodaXWkoaY4NxRC1SlvIhnglh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>5.5: Brands Festival, khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i t\u1eeb c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 Nike, L\u2019Or\u00e9al, Xiaomi.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFo3dOwJYohw6TxOZ7pl0dMFgmh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>6.6: Mid-Year Mega Sale, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 s\u00e2u cho \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, \u0111\u1ed3 gia d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 th\u1eddi trang.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V6vMdGthUof44CxxDgzlCkTKgbc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>7.7: Orange Madness, \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i cho c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 v\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJAjdK4OXoEwkHx2NMdly8dwgxf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>8.8: Brands Festival, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 m\u1ea1nh t\u1eeb c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U1WHdupS8ogwxAxuyfwlKxHogTb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>9.9: Super Shopping Day, m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng sale l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t n\u0103m v\u1edbi h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uti7d8jCtor8ESxXyB1lL4DAg4d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>10.10: Mobile Shopping Day, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DlmSdQLzHono9zxxrhMleFzjgnd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>11.11: Singles\u2019 Day Sale, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n mua s\u1eafm l\u1edbn nh\u1ea5t th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi v\u1edbi \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i kh\u1ee7ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQRGdOvi9oR9JPxHqMqlQtDng5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>12.12: Birthday Sale, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m sinh nh\u1eadt Shopee, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 to\u00e0n s\u00e0n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-H7ExdYHsuo8mLbxANTdlU1QagCc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2.2. C\u00e1c \u0111\u1ee3t sale l\u1edbn theo d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-REVsdZkI9oyLkGxhw3Hle5Sdgec\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ebft Nguy\u00ean \u0110\u00e1n: tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 sau T\u1ebft (th\u00e1ng 1 \u2013 2)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PEoSdaaEsovWLTxwBSglQIHZgHd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>L\u1ec5 T\u00ecnh Nh\u00e2n 14.2<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ENwed5l3Co5ScVx8sihlgDpcgRh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf Ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef 8.3<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OqFcdtCt6oMrAFxG66ulyUDXgDe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf Lao \u0111\u1ed9ng 1.5<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NF4sdmrYzoXkcQxZ28xlsFWYgpf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>L\u1ec5 Vu Lan \u2013 th\u00e1ng 7 \u00e2m l\u1ecbch<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X1Mfdw76Ro66dkxFz0RlRjtIgGd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ng\u00e0y Nh\u00e0 gi\u00e1o Vi\u1ec7t Nam 20.11<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T2YddtI0roaKqxxqMcflyRcMgSi\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Black Friday (cu\u1ed1i th\u00e1ng 11)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P0UqdzxzkolbgRxJhUolGAJJg2g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Cyber Monday (\u0111\u1ea7u th\u00e1ng 12)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y9TedSWyUoYb03xpzzHlKt5sgY4\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Gi\u00e1ng Sinh &amp; T\u1ebft D\u01b0\u01a1ng L\u1ecbch<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OEwfdfL8Lo0VRsxZlmIlWhs0gcd\">3. C\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i Voucher gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 tr\u00ean Shopee<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-XpvWdEsiUodxAnxWCoKlUSQvgVf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3.1. M\u00e3 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n (Freeship)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PyuEdfhZeocyJUx3UxelGBRCgOf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 lo\u1ea1i voucher do Shopee ph\u00e1t h\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1ea3m ho\u1eb7c mi\u1ec5n to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea1t m\u1ee9c t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u. M\u00e3 th\u01b0\u1eddng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng to\u00e0n s\u00e0n ho\u1eb7c theo t\u1eebng ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNzAdlSyvo3vn9xgZWIlPyiqg5g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed d\u1ee5: \u201cFreeship Xtra\u201d gi\u00fap gi\u1ea3m 20.000\u0111 cho \u0111\u01a1n t\u1eeb 50.000\u0111, ho\u1eb7c m\u00e3 freeship 30.000\u0111 cho \u0111\u01a1n t\u1eeb 99.000\u0111. Voucher th\u01b0\u1eddng xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n v\u00e0o c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ee3t sale l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 9.9, 10.10, 11.11 ho\u1eb7c v\u00e0o cu\u1ed1i tu\u1ea7n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PP1odSAZjofadRx4LFNlbGR3gxt\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u01b0u \u00fd: M\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y, s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f3 gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n v\u00e0 voucher th\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ebft r\u1ea5t nhanh. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng n\u00ean l\u01b0u v\u00e0o v\u00ed tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng khi thanh to\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GreOdkQ8Oo5WgHxMf8ul1KN4gwe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3.2. M\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 t\u1eeb gian h\u00e0ng (M\u00e3 shop)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qy6Dd7s7nozc7nxjtm3lSC4Agyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 voucher \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o b\u1edfi ch\u00ednh nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng nh\u1eb1m k\u00edch th\u00edch \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n kh\u00e1ch c\u0169 ho\u1eb7c thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch m\u1edbi. T\u00f9y v\u00e0o chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c, shop c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 gian h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HtTqdX9pQoeStlxzTiIl9QFNgzh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed d\u1ee5: M\u1ed9t shop th\u1eddi trang c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m 20.000\u0111 cho \u0111\u01a1n t\u1eeb 199.000\u0111, ho\u1eb7c gi\u1ea3m 10% t\u1ed1i \u0111a 50.000\u0111 cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MApPdd2G8oEUUgxCoc1lAt6dgbe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo Shopee, c\u00e1c gian h\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean tung m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 ri\u00eang c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng cao h\u01a1n t\u1eeb 30% \u0111\u1ebfn 50% so v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng shop kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng m\u00e3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DNejdh4wuoDCqFxbR2ulD107g2c\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3.3. M\u00e3 ho\u00e0n xu (Shopee Xu)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BvBndGnLQosDuGxbqj6lBIswgMw\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Lo\u1ea1i m\u00e3 n\u00e0y gi\u00fap kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n l\u1ea1i m\u1ed9t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng Shopee Xu t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng v\u1edbi gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng sau khi giao d\u1ecbch ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t. Shopee Xu c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ec3 thanh to\u00e1n t\u1ed1i \u0111a 10% gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp theo.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LrmOdeDfgonOssxzqkmlEqtYgSe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed d\u1ee5: Ho\u00e0n 10.000 xu cho \u0111\u01a1n t\u1eeb 200.000\u0111, t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1ea3m 10.000\u0111 cho l\u1ea7n mua sau.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HkPGdMb5jo3O1DxIl6dlOKcXgWe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00edch l\u0169y t\u1ed1i \u0111a 50.000 xu m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng n\u1ebfu th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean mua s\u1eafm v\u00e0 t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng m\u00e3 ho\u00e0n xu hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DcnPdEb3UoMQlQxRNn2learagMh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3.4. M\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 t\u1eeb ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u00e2n thi\u1ebft<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PImvdEvleotMQ8xAmMOlowD9gbf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee ph\u00e2n chia kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh 4 h\u1ea1ng: \u0110\u1ed3ng, B\u1ea1c, V\u00e0ng v\u00e0 B\u1ea1ch Kim d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean t\u1ed5ng chi ti\u00eau v\u00e0 t\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t mua s\u1eafm. M\u1ed7i h\u1ea1ng s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u00f3i \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i ri\u00eang m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng bao g\u1ed3m voucher gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1, m\u00e3 freeship, m\u00e3 ho\u00e0n xu.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HnfwdObg1ov5ooxx0AZlsrAYgEe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed d\u1ee5: Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng h\u1ea1ng B\u1ea1ch Kim c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn t\u1edbi 10 m\u00e3 freeship v\u00e0 5 m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 t\u1ed5ng tr\u1ecb gi\u00e1 200.000\u0111 m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TzhMd6MRoovMpuxu5Dilni1fgzc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh n\u00e0y gi\u00fap duy tr\u00ec h\u00e0nh vi mua s\u1eafm \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng n\u00e2ng h\u1ea1ng th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4498\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4498\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4498\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/54.png\" alt=\"\u00c1p m\u00e3, \u00e1p voucher \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m t\u1ed1i \u0111a chi ph\u00ed khi mua h\u00e0ng online.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/54.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/54-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/54-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/54-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/54-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4498\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u00c1p m\u00e3, \u00e1p voucher \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m t\u1ed1i \u0111a chi ph\u00ed khi mua h\u00e0ng online.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"J3uFdh1kpo46KrxyEvTlYNzTgcf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KsLgdRJ47ol6skxOhfFl6POKg6X\" style=\"text-align: left;\">4. C\u00e1ch s\u0103n sale Shopee deal nhanh si\u00eau ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m, gi\u00e1 gi\u1ea3m shock tr\u00ean Shopee<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRhndSgHdokqP2xRMW9le9qcgZd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u0103n deal nhanh, si\u00eau ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 gi\u1ea3m s\u1ed1c tr\u00ean Shopee, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecf l\u1ee1 c\u00e1c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn trong c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ee3t sale<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CUQGdKdNDoWysgxgtuYlTpNngxe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo d\u00f5i l\u1ecbch sale l\u1edbn v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t nh\u1eafc nh\u1edf s\u1edbm<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BbJ2diKh2oPGZMxSVdQlvRREgjh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ee3t si\u00eau sale v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y \u0111\u00f4i v\u00e0 l\u1ec5 l\u1edbn trong n\u0103m nh\u01b0 2.2, 3.3, 9.9, 11.11, 12.12 ho\u1eb7c T\u1ebft, Back To School&#8230; M\u1ed7i \u0111\u1ee3t sale s\u1ebd c\u00f3 lo\u1ea1t m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u00e0 flash sale gi\u00e1 s\u1ed1c. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua n\u00ean \u201cth\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf\u201d s\u1edbm, b\u1eadt th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o v\u00e0 d\u00f9ng app Shopee \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn nh\u1eafc nh\u1edf tr\u01b0\u1edbc gi\u1edd s\u0103n deal.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>C\u00e1ch 1: S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng \u201cS\u0103n M\u00e3\u201d trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WNQrddmusoyt7sxVxbXlXT3PgYg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00e0o m\u1ee5c \u201cS\u0103n m\u00e3 freeship &amp; gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1\u201d trong app, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u01b0u c\u00e1c m\u00e3 \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i t\u1eeb Shopee, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n ho\u1eb7c m\u00e3 ho\u00e0n xu. C\u00e1c m\u00e3 th\u01b0\u1eddng ph\u00e1t h\u00e0nh theo khung gi\u1edd v\u00e0ng (00h, 12h, 20h). M\u1eb9o: n\u00ean canh gi\u1edd s\u0103n v\u00e0 l\u01b0u tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0o v\u00ed \u0111\u1ec3 nhanh tay \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng khi thanh to\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>C\u00e1ch 2: Canh mua Flash Sale v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m s\u00e2u theo khung gi\u1edd c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BBmRdorqIogiwhx0xssl9suRg9b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee c\u00f3 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh <strong>Flash Sale m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y<\/strong>, th\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0o c\u00e1c khung gi\u1edd: 0h, 9h, 12h, 15h, 18h v\u00e0 21h. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 s\u1ed1c, c\u00f3 khi l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 70% \u2013 90%. V\u00ed d\u1ee5: n\u1ed3i chi\u00ean kh\u00f4ng d\u1ea7u t\u1eeb 2.000.000\u0111 c\u00f2n 990.000\u0111 ho\u1eb7c son m\u00f4i t\u1eeb 200.000\u0111 c\u00f2n 29.000\u0111. Tuy nhi\u00ean, s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ef1c gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n, c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1eb7t c\u1ef1c nhanh.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>C\u00e1ch 3: D\u00f9ng Shopee Xu v\u00e0 m\u00e3 ho\u00e0n xu \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3m th\u00eam gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LSold0cEXoWimMxxkQjlX2BvgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u00edch l\u0169y Shopee Xu qua vi\u1ec7c mua h\u00e0ng, check-in m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y, ch\u01a1i game tr\u00ean app. Khi thanh to\u00e1n, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng Shopee Xu \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3m t\u1ed1i \u0111a 10% gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng. K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p th\u00eam m\u00e3 ho\u00e0n xu \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m cho l\u1ea7n mua ti\u1ebfp theo.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>C\u00e1ch 4: S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ShopeePay \u0111\u1ec3 h\u01b0\u1edfng \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4BodTPfkocBz3xHl53lRFQqgch\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Thanh to\u00e1n b\u1eb1ng v\u00ed ShopeePay s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i th\u00eam nh\u01b0 m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m ri\u00eang, m\u00e3 ho\u00e0n xu nhi\u1ec1u h\u01a1n, ho\u1eb7c freeship \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n. Trong c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ee3t sale l\u1edbn, ShopeePay c\u00f2n c\u00f3 c\u00e1c deal &#8220;1k \u2013 9k&#8221; gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n trong ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>C\u00e1ch 5: So s\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 &amp; theo d\u00f5i shop uy t\u00edn tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi mua<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Big9da13toJzkEx5OazlxVl1g6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 \u201cSo s\u00e1nh gi\u00e1\u201d ho\u1eb7c theo d\u00f5i nh\u1eefng shop c\u00f3 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng &#8220;Y\u00eau th\u00edch+&#8221; ho\u1eb7c &#8220;Mall&#8221; \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn n\u01a1i mua \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady, tr\u00e1nh deal \u1ea3o. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nh\u01b0 ShopeePlus, CanhDeal, ho\u1eb7c tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t c\u00f3 add-on gi\u00fap theo d\u00f5i l\u1ecbch s\u1eed gi\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u0169ng r\u1ea5t h\u1eefu \u00edch.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Roj5dtsyxojhRmxI7dElxFGDghh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>T\u00f3m l\u1ea1i:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7c n\u1eafm r\u00f5 l\u1ecbch sale, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u0103n m\u00e3 \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0 d\u00f9ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n mua s\u1eafm hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, s\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c deal gi\u00e1 s\u1ed1c m\u00e0 v\u1eabn ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3. N\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n m\u00ecnh g\u1ee3i \u00fd deal hot theo ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, h\u00e3y n\u00f3i nh\u00e9!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KLYKdiOLOoArekxee0AlwpWCg5c\" style=\"text-align: left;\">5. C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4500\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4500\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4500\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/56-1.png\" alt=\"Q&amp;A\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/56-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/56-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/56-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/56-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/56-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4500\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. L\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 s\u0103n deal 1k, 0\u0111 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean Shopee?<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Frc1dz0nEoQgbDxTo0ll06vKgDb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 s\u0103n deal 1k ho\u1eb7c 0\u0111 th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb s\u1eb5n danh s\u00e1ch s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m mong mu\u1ed1n v\u00e0 th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc gi\u1edd m\u1edf b\u00e1n. \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee v\u00e0 k\u00edch ho\u1ea1t ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n nhanh nh\u01b0 ShopeePay. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i internet \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ebd gi\u00fap qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng nhanh h\u01a1n. Shopee th\u01b0\u1eddng th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o c\u00e1c khung gi\u1edd Flash Sale nh\u01b0 0h, 9h, 12h, do \u0111\u00f3 b\u1ea1n n\u00ean b\u1eadt nh\u1eafc nh\u1edf ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ecbch \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecf l\u1ee1. Nhi\u1ec1u deal 0\u0111 c\u00f2n y\u00eau c\u1ea7u m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ho\u1eb7c \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, n\u00ean vi\u1ec7c theo d\u00f5i ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 r\u1ea5t quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"J3uFdh1kpo46KrxyEvTlYNzTgcf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. Shopee Mall c\u00f3 \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady h\u01a1n c\u00e1c gian h\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1eddng kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFhaduhXyoPkY8x496JlX7gPg9c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee Mall l\u00e0 khu v\u1ef1c t\u1eadp h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee x\u00e1c minh, n\u00ean m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady cao h\u01a1n so v\u1edbi c\u00e1c gian h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cam k\u1ebft nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng v\u00e0 n\u1ebfu ph\u00e1t hi\u1ec7n h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3 s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n g\u1ea5p \u0111\u00f4i. Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 c\u0169ng r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 thu\u1eadn ti\u1ec7n h\u01a1n, th\u01b0\u1eddng k\u00e9o d\u00e0i t\u1eeb 7 \u0111\u1ebfn 15 ng\u00e0y. D\u00f9 gi\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m trong Shopee Mall c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nh\u1ec9nh h\u01a1n m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat, ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00f9 l\u1ea1i b\u1eb1ng ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 h\u1eadu m\u00e3i t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n, bao g\u1ed3m \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n v\u00e0 m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 ri\u00eang ch\u1ec9 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng cho Mall.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. Khung gi\u1edd Flash Sale n\u00e0o c\u00f3 deal t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t (0h, 9h, 12h, v.v.)?<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ix9qdTzeSolUdWxbNoVl4hZDgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1c khung gi\u1edd nh\u01b0 0h, 12h v\u00e0 21h th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m s\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u deal gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t. C\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, khung 0h l\u00e0 l\u00fac Shopee tung ra nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e3 gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m hot nh\u1ea5t trong ng\u00e0y, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp sale l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 9.9 ho\u1eb7c 11.11. Khung 12h th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 d\u00e2n v\u0103n ph\u00f2ng, h\u00e0ng ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ee9c n\u0103ng. Khung 21h l\u00e0 th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng online nhi\u1ec1u, th\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f3 c\u00e1c m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7, gia d\u1ee5ng, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 s\u00e2u. D\u00f9 c\u00e1c khung gi\u1edd nh\u01b0 9h hay 18h c\u0169ng c\u00f3 \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i, nh\u01b0ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng deal hot kh\u00f4ng b\u1eb1ng ba khung gi\u1edd ch\u00ednh n\u00f3i tr\u00ean.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KAPmdqmrWod9Q3xzPkbl1ooEgob\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JSaGdbjwLoEcNMxyaJOlL67dgCe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JMuadY5BeoxxcXxZOFZlgPe3gTd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9:<\/strong> 202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4G8deCpIohho2x39t4l2XCugyc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qy7BdkoJWogAEdxmduyltJiMgkf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\